graph TB
    %% External Entry Points
    User[👤 User] --> Copilot[💬 GitHub Copilot Chat]
    Copilot --> Entry[🎯 CORTEX Entry Point<br/>CORTEX.prompt.md]
    
    %% Core Routing
    Entry --> Router{🔀 Unified Router<br/>Intent Classification}
    
    %% Execution Methods
    Router -->|CLI Operations| CLI[⚙️ CLI Wrappers<br/>8 System Operations]
    Router -->|Interactive| Chat[💬 Copilot Chat<br/>16 Workflows]
    Router -->|Internal| Internal[🔧 Internal APIs<br/>276 Operations]
    
    %% Orchestrators
    CLI --> Orch[🎭 Orchestrators]
    Chat --> Orch
    Internal --> Orch
    
    Orch --> TDD[TDD Orchestrator<br/>RED→GREEN→REFACTOR]
    Orch --> Planning[Planning Orchestrator<br/>Feature Planning]
    Orch --> Maint[Maintenance Orchestrator<br/>7-Phase Workflow]
    Orch --> Doc[Documentation Orchestrator<br/>Auto-Doc Generation]
    Orch --> Refine[Refinement Orchestrator<br/>System Optimization]
    Orch --> Sanitize[Code Sanitization<br/>5-Phase Pipeline]
    Orch --> ADO[ADO Orchestrator<br/>Work Item Generation]
    Orch --> Vision[Vision API Orchestrator<br/>Mockup Analysis]
    
    %% Agents
    Orch --> Corpus[🧠 Corpus Callosum<br/>Agent Coordinator]
    Corpus --> SPE[📚 Strategic Planning<br/>Expert Agent]
    Corpus --> IE[🔍 Investigation<br/>Expert Agent]
    
    %% 4-Tier Brain
    Orch --> Brain[🧠 4-Tier Brain]
    SPE --> Brain
    IE --> Brain
    
    Brain --> T0[Tier 0: Governance<br/>SKULL Rules]
    Brain --> T1[Tier 1: Working Memory<br/>70-Conv FIFO <100ms]
    Brain --> T2[Tier 2: Knowledge Graph<br/>Pattern Learning]
    Brain --> T3[Tier 3: Dev Context<br/>Metrics & Hotspots]
    
    %% Storage
    T1 --> DB1[(cortex-brain.db<br/>Conversations)]
    T2 --> DB2[(cortex-brain.db<br/>Patterns)]
    T3 --> DB3[(cortex_metrics.db<br/>Metrics & Hotspots)]
    
    Orch --> Alerts[(cortex_alerts.db<br/>System Alerts)]
    Orch --> Status[(cortex_status.db<br/>Health Status)]
    
    %% External Integrations
    Orch --> Git[🔗 Git Integration<br/>Checkpoints & Commits]
    Orch --> VSCode[🔗 VS Code Integration<br/>Editor Commands]
    ADO --> AzureDevOps[🔗 Azure DevOps<br/>Work Items]
    
    %% Response System
    Orch --> Response[📋 Response Templates<br/>62 Templates v4.0]
    Response --> Output[📤 Formatted Output<br/>Adaptive Format]
    Output --> User
    
